      "contextId": "p069-c4",
      "start": 665,
      "end": 705,
      "groups": [
        "p069-u0008-individual"
      ],
      "sourceText": "فَهَلْ تَرَىٰ لَهُم مِّن بَاقِيَةٍ۸"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0009",
      "text": "کسانی که پیش از",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(5) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "4842e059ac9bb66ec665f02879865d939b261f9cacadb4b66d13fc533ca0faaa",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 9,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p069-s0001",
      "contextId": "p069-c5",
      "start": 737,
      "end": 753,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-42c9664246"
      ],
      "sourceText": "فِرْعَوْنُ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0010",
      "text": "بودند و مردم شهرهای",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(5) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "0ffe7bb56febe461925dd7e8d4d70e939f038d368abde6905d8a4862596c5234",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 9,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p069-s0001",
      "contextId": "p069-c5",
      "start": 756,
      "end": 775,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-42c9664246"
      ],
      "sourceText": "مَن قَبْلَهُ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0011",
      "text": "زیر و رو شده [قوم لوط]",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(5) > span:nth-of-type(3)",
      "textHash": "9c4b77c57bb841b9810e98641dfa35502552fb86b06ee80f7ec1e2916f305bfd",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 9,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p069-s0001",
      "contextId": "p069-c5",
      "start": 776,
      "end": 799,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-42c9664246"
      ],
      "sourceText": "الْمُؤْتَفِكَاتُ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0012",
      "text": "تا آن را برای شما مایه تذکر و بیداری قرار دهیم و گوش شنوا آن را [به عنوان مایه عبرت و تذکر] حفظ کند.۱۲",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(7) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "63f6aff5913608fda85f4d934d336771550cdf196773f22924b08ff0dcb22f10",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-border-left-1px-dotted-gray-100 ul-border-right-1px-dotted-gray-100 ul-border-top-0 ul-color-currentcolor ul-pad-x-0p264583mm ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-none ul-thickness-0",
        "structure": "ul-border-left-1px-dotted-gray-100 ul-border-right-1px-dotted-gray-100 ul-border-top-0 ul-pad-x-0p264583mm ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-none ul-thickness-0",
        "colorFamily": null
      },
      "verse": 12,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p069-s0001",
      "contextId": "p069-c6",
      "start": 1008,
      "end": 1110,
      "groups": [
        "p069-u0012-individual"
      ],
      "sourceText": "لِنَجْعَلَهَا لَكُمْ تَذْكِرَةً وَتَعِيَهَا أُذُنٌ وَاعِيَةٌ۱۲"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0013",
      "text": "آن را برای شما مایه تذکر و بیداری قرار دهیم و گوش",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(7) > span:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "7d534e8f94deddcc492ed4e24d6c979707da19d5b511d6e5bc56642b63da78f5",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-220 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 12,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "parentId": "p069-u0012",
      "sectionId": "p069-s0001",
      "contextId": "p069-c6",
      "start": 1011,
      "end": 1061,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-ec7e589a22"
      ],
      "sourceText": "نَجْعَلَهَا لَكُمْ تَذْكِرَةً"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0014",
      "text": "آن را [به عنوان مایه عبرت و تذکر] حفظ کند.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(7) > span:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "499f7e8953c7ab0ad8f6e68e9f34168fa9ba14649ec3f4f66e42e8f335198992",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-220 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 12,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "parentId": "p069-u0012",
      "sectionId": "p069-s0001",
      "contextId": "p069-c6",
      "start": 1065,
      "end": 1108,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-ec7e589a22"
      ],
      "sourceText": "تَعِيَهَا أُذُنٌ وَاعِيَةٌ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0015",
      "text": "زمین و کوه ها از جای خود برداشته شوند و هر دوی آنها یک باره درهم کوبیده و ریز ریز گردند!",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "3e9d4b74dd3c3f6ddf8a6f1adb73166e4dcd0183808113656141af66c92769be",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-3px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-3px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 14,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p069-c7",
      "start": 1176,
      "end": 1264,
      "groups": [
        "p069-local-underline-pattern-d2ceb6a06c"
      ],
      "sourceText": "حُمِلَتِ الْأَرْضُ وَالْجِبَالُ فَدُكَّتَا دَكَّةً وَاحِدَةً"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0016",
      "text": "از جای خود",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "1b571ee0d04de4e6af420ce655824f3eb4bf097879e3d0e0d6ce4c931916bd38",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 14,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": "p069-u0015",
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p069-c7",
      "start": 1190,
      "end": 1201,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-a045cd7f6a"
      ],
      "sourceText": "الْأَرْضُ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0017",
      "text": "شوند و هر دوی",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "9e5746d533e9f2d3404e3f944d98a7776f000ec02a17cb91afbefbbf5f9f89da",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 14,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": "p069-u0015",
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p069-c7",
      "start": 1208,
      "end": 1223,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-a045cd7f6a"
      ],
      "sourceText": "الْجِبَالُ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0018",
      "text": "آسمان بشکافد و در آن روز است که از هم گسسته و متلاشی گردد؛",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "25109a0a5229cec70cfe05cf761a2cddf7dd54e8ee72b3b3269fc1eb73b63870",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-3px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-3px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 16,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p069-c7",
      "start": 1314,
      "end": 1372,
      "groups": [
        "p069-local-underline-pattern-d2ceb6a06c"
      ],
      "sourceText": "انشَقَّتِ السَّمَاءُ فَهِيَ يَوْمَئِذٍ وَاهِيَةٌ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0019",
      "text": "فرشتگان [برای اجرای دستورها حق] بر کناره ها و",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(3)",
      "textHash": "caf13440fd5114255083d2143c13a9d8b476ecf1295e1911ee526f573660f5a5",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 17,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p069-c7",
      "start": 1376,
      "end": 1422,
      "groups": [
        "p069-textual-coordination-024656cdb0"
      ],
      "sourceText": "الْمَلَكُ عَلَىٰ أَرْجَائِهَا"
    },
    {
      "id": "p069-u0020",
      "text": "آسمان قرار می گیرند، ودر آن روز هشت فرشته، عرش پروردگارت را بر فراز همه آنها حمل می کنند.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(3) > span:nth-of-type(4)",
      "textHash": "e97340b7adebe3a7aee1f50f2c3aef919faf756dbbddaa39c70678444c10e870",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 17,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p069-c7",
